low.func.def target<amd.xdna.aie2p.core> abi(object_function) @addresses_to_i64(%indices: reg<aie2p.vec256 x2>, %offsets: reg<aie2p.vec256 x2>) -> (reg<aie2p.vec256 x4>, reg<aie2p.vec256 x4>) asm {
